<!ENTITY zoolrunner.quote
'<span>The Outcast looked upon the Lunar Path and, certain of his wisdom, declared:</span>
<span>“There is only the Library.”</span>
<span>And the Serpents beheld his works.</span>
<span>And they laughed.</span>
<span>Then they cast the Library into the dust and spoke:</span>
<span>“There is only the Runner.”</span>'>

